  motivated him to get in control of his  life and choose to be happy  he has since become an author and is now  an international motivational speaker  jessica cox when it comes to living life  to the fullest  jessica cox lets nothing hold her back  born without both arms due to a birth  defect cox has still been able to live a  full  and exciting life she is the first  armless person to receive a pilot's  license as well as being the first  armless person to receive a black belt  from the american taekwondo association  she's even able to perform simple  everyday tasks like putting in her  contacts or typing on a keyboard with  her feet her motivational speeches are  now a source of inspiration in 20  countries around the world  sean ross another model that is all  about self-acceptance is sean ross who  is regarded as the first professional  model with albinism  instead of letting his appearance get in  his way he decided to embrace his looks  and try to help others do the same  ross started the in my skin i win  movement which helps encourage others  who have felt hurt  because they look different he hopes his  movement will help people shape the way  they look at themselves which will  hopefully lead to self-worth and  happiness  ariana paige russell though her skin  condition dermatographia never really  held her back  ariana paige russell wanted to turn her  irritating flaw into a work of art  dermatographia is a rare skin condition  that leaves ariana's skin hypersensitive  so it gets red and swollen when  irritated  it got so bad that her friends would  tease her for how easily she turned red  she eventually went to her doctor and  got the non-life-threatening condition  diagnosis  she now uses her skin condition to  create works of art on her skin that  she's turned into wallpaper  videos and even temporary tattoos she  has also started a blog about her  condition to help others who are  struggling with the same  sir major growing up with albinism which  ca